WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.357
Views can also create a narrower interface for analytics.

00:00:05.357 --> 00:00:13.322
For example, an analyst may need age group, city, and activity status, but not the patient's name, email address,

00:00:13.322 --> 00:00:19.062
or date of birth. A view can expose only the fields needed for that task.

00:00:19.618 --> 00:00:25.485
That can reduce accidental exposure, but it is important to use precise language.

00:00:25.485 --> 00:00:31.870
Hiding a column in a view does not automatically prevent someone from querying the base table.

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:39.279
Real access control still depends on permissions, roles, and sometimes row level security.
